{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/202659X3Cwn1yq1793138437.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>南非國營貨運鐵路公司日前試行有接近700節車廂的超長火車，有望打破全球最長貨運火車的紀錄。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.SA.TRAIN-0100.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026IIFw5edDqu1793138443.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>鐵路公司宣稱是全球最長貨運火車，共有690多節車廂，全長達7.6公里。為了確保有足夠動力，部分位置加設電力或柴油機車。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.SA.TRAIN-0100_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20261IosTzy4bh1793138440.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>本月18日，列車在沒有載貨的情況下從南非西南部港口，駛往860公里外的鐵礦區。鐵路公司已呈交相關資料，等待健力士世界紀錄官方認證。2001年，澳洲有礦業火車開出火車，全長約7.3公里。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.SA.TRAIN-0100_004.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026HtGGrXlGU81793138435.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T22:40:19.504530+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":198,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T21:59:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T15:55:32.465114+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T22:38:16.864279+00:00","content_hash":"064459bd8fd6111a24fc38b0fac04fa9205619cd8a8b0646cf76b8e0f4a370f8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T22:40:19.504530+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}